    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 0030cb70ad7eba22e9f7c18c15037a1d905b0b84 -->\n**Review (M3, inline, independent of the author): Ready for the maintainer to merge, after #566.**\n\n- **Scope:** the PR is stacked on #566. Its base is `main`, so it carries #566's commits, and those were reviewed clean at cafce25d. Its own change is 0030cb70.\n- **The fix:**\n  - In `shell_layout`'s pre-dock check, `locate_pick::disarm` now sits beside #667's `axis_pick::disarm_all`.\n  - So a hidden Properties pane drops the locate draft before the dock can route a same-frame viewport release to it.\n  - `disarm` only clears `locate_pick`, with no side effects, and the after-dock `sweep` stays as the backstop.\n- **Pinning test:** `setup_picks_disarm::a_click_in_the_frame_the_pane_hides_misses_the_hidden_locate_draft`.\n  - With the fix, it and the other 6 `setup_picks_disarm` tests pass.\n  - With the 3 lines reverted, it fails at line 373 (the release reaches the draft). It pins the fix.\n- **Trial merge with upstream/main:** clean.\n- **Clippy:** `-D warnings` on ui `--lib --tests` is clean.\n- **Not run:** I did not launch the GUI.\n- **Non-blocking:** `shell.rs` was already well past 400 lines (1678), and this adds 3.\n\nRequested changes: none. Merge #566 first; the shared commits then drop out of this diff.",
